      "t": "html",
      "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> ThrowAsException <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_EM_02289\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_ExecutionManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_EM_02289]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00120\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00120</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00121\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00121</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00130\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00130</a>, <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00159\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00159</a></span></h3>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void ThrowAsException (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_ErrorCode_538b08.html\">ara::core::ErrorCode</a> &amp;errorCode) const noexcept(false) override;</pre>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
    {
      "t": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Creates a new instance of ExecException from errorCode and throws it as a C++ exception. As per <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10304\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10304]</a>, this function does not participate in overload resolution when C++ exceptions are disabled in the compiler toolchain.</p></div>",
      "tail": "\n"
    },
